  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda, Malawi. the &quot;Umunthu&quot; exchange project. This initiative aims to reduce vulnerabilities emanating from trafficking, sexual abuse, and exploitation by leveraging each other&apos;s strengths, particularly through the power of sports to empower young people. They will utilize sports as a tool for promoting physical health, teamwork, and
leadership skills among young people. Through sports tournaments, fitness classes, and
recreational activities, Chance for Change and Advance Afrika not only foster physical fitness but
also encourage community mobilization and social cohesion.</narrative>
  </description>
